usage: x86 [-h] [--version]
           {vsk,assets,sandbox,vmapple,personality,detect,build,patch,mellow,status,wizard}
           ...

NextCore — x86 Mac OpenCore EFI build and root patch tooling

positional arguments:
  {vsk,assets,sandbox,vmapple,personality,detect,build,patch,mellow,status,wizard}
    vsk                 Validate VSK configuration offline; never authorize
                        boot
    assets              Read-only original guest asset inspection and
                        integrity
    sandbox             Apple Silicon Sandbox EFI status and self-test staging
    vmapple             Run the caller-supplied VMApple research VM with a
                        visible GTK/SDL window
    personality         Validate the iBoot(AArch64) macOS-only guest policy
    detect              Mac 모델 및 하드웨어 정보 확인
    build               OpenCore EFI 빌드 (macOS 전용)
    patch               루트 볼륨 패치 적용 (macOS 전용)
    mellow              Mellow driver/root-patch 준비 및 검증
    status              설정·패치·EFI 상태 요약
    wizard              기본 GUI 마법사 실행

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
